      <link>https://111.230.153.15/news/?batch=smart-20261122-143735&amp;cat=tech&amp;event=evt_25652e9c44ef</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">smart-20261122-143735:evt_25652e9c44ef</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 18:00:00 +0800</pubDate>
      <category>tech</category>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;可信度：&lt;/strong&gt;多独立来源提及（待核官方全文）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;OpenAI 公布针对敌对蒸馏（adversarial distillation）的分层防护措施，将模型训练、安全护栏、异常检测与执法手段结合以防止外部提取模型能力。据 OpenAI 披露的自适应红队测试结果，针对 GPT-6.2 Astra 与 GPT-6.2 Sol 受保护内部推理（思考链）的提取成功率已从 54% 降至 0.2%。同期行业报道称，OpenAI 已配合推进大规模封号行动以打击违规蒸馏行为。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;参考信源：&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://the-decoder.com/openai-makes-it-much-harder-for-attackers-to-extract-how-its-latest-ai-models-think"&gt;来源&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href="https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1LRXFjT09RWXQ5eDBoSXRyaFkzQzE2Um9kcnhjV2JpVEFsMVZZMDhZT3B5U2hKU3lNcnJsV19TaFExVWU5QUgxNw?oc=5"&gt;来源&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href="https://openai.com/index/combatting-adversarial-distillation"&gt;来源&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href="https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxOeFlIOVlFSXlTemttVFdiUmdCR1BJREFqMXpYenJCVUswSk9DZU1EUEd1YjZpZGh6SkNrdFFYVlZnM01UblJiOHlyMGFVOXRQMDJ3MzczTkk4SHh2SmJubk1uaWxkN2JzXzFidnV3SXptNTYwbjBPWUU2dlNjVUVfNWRtdjlaSGYzUWJyRA?oc=5"&gt;来源&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
